    "media:imagetext": "Alcoholic Beverages\nAperitifs\nVermouth - Martini Dry \u0026 Martini Rosso\nCampari\nCocktails\nBloody Mary\nManhattan\nGin Fizz\nCollins\nScrewdriver\nSours\nHighballs\nMartinis\nSpirits\nChivas Royal Salute\nJohnnie Walker Black Label\nJack Daniel's Tennessee Whisky\nGordon's Gin\nSmirnoff Vodka\nCognac Hennessy XO\nBacardi Rum\nBeers\nInternational Selection\nLiqueurs\nGrand Marnier\nDrambuie\nTia Maria\nBailey's Irish Cream\nPort\nTaylor's Fine Tawny\nCHAMPAGNE\nOTAO DON\nChampagne\nCuvie Dom Perignon\nDOM PERIGNON\nA delicious bottle of bubbly, fresh and ripe with flavours\nof citrus fruit and mineral with a creamy, toasty finish.\nNamed after a famous monk who was influential in the\ndevelopment of Champagne into the sparkling wine we\nknow today. Dom Perignon is the prestige cuvee of the\ngiant Moet et Chandon House. It is praised for its \"well\norchestrated, precise, and full bodied taste\".\nThe hallmark of Dom Perignon is tiny pinpoint bubbles\nand a lush creamy feel on the palate.",
